cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Semiconductor Device Simulation: 2D MOSFET DEVSIM Study"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anjum
    given-names: Ali
repository-code: "https://github.com/alianjum-web/semiconductor-device-simulation"
abstract: >-
  Physics-based 2D planar MOSFET device simulation built on the open-source
  DEVSIM TCAD engine, with a systematic parameter study across channel
  length, gate oxide thickness, and channel doping, and a low-power
  drive-current/leakage-current trade-off analysis. See
  docs/project_manual.md for full scope.
